 "usage_rules": {
  "R1_corral": "room 0 `corral` only: wall scorches are backwall_decal on the world bond (x % 32 == 0, y % 16 == 0) and outside every torch pool; floor decals lie in the deck's back half (y 561..572) and never on a step; the step fronts lie exactly on the step rects (their top row, stone 8, is the walkable arris); props stand on the floor back line (y 560); nothing at x 1372..1428 (the partition, CORRAL-D). The partition frames are drawn by the presenter, never placed."
 }
